const contentHtml = `<p class="lead">Most home service businesses make marketing decisions based on gut feeling. The contractors who scale past $5 million in revenue make decisions based on data. This article compiles 100 verified statistics from industry research, government data, and platform-specific reports to give you the benchmarks you need to evaluate your marketing, justify your budget, and outrank your competitors.</p>
